    <text>
      <div number="1">
        <div number="1">
          <unit id="en_1" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">A copy of the book of the words of the Visions of Amram son of Kohath son of Levi, all that he revealed to his sons and that he commanded them on the day of his death, in the one hundred and thirty-sixth year, that is, the year of his death, in the one hundred and fifty-second year of the exile of Israel to Egypt.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="2">
          <unit id="en_2" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">[...] passed over him. And he sent and called Uzziel his younger brother.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="3">
          <unit id="en_3" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">[...and he took for him] Miriam his daughter as a wife, a daughter of thirty years.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="4">
          <unit id="en_4" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">And he made her wedding feast for seven days.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="5">
          <unit id="en_5" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">And he ate and drank at her wedding feast and rejoiced.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="6">
          <unit id="en_6" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">Then, when the days of the wedding feast were completed, he sent and called Aaron his son, approximately twenty years old [...].</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="7">
          <unit id="en_7" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">[...And he said] to him, “My son, call for me Milkiyah, your sister, from the house of Pharaoh.”</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="8">
          <unit id="en_8" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">[...his] might was upon him, and he called her.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="9">
          <unit id="en_9" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">[...I am com]manding.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="10">
          <unit id="en_10" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">[...his father] commanded.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="11">
          <unit id="en_11" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">[...] from [Pharaoh's house...]</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div number="2">
        <div number="1">
          <unit id="en_12" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">[...] your word.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="2">
          <unit id="en_13" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">And he will give you [</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
        <div number="3">
          <unit id="en_14" group="0" parallel="">
            <reading option="0" mss="OCP-Trans ">] generations.</reading>
          </unit>
        </div>
